---
// 原版 trauma 版式城市剪影：skyline.svg 以 CSS background 平铺，与原版 #extra-div-* 实现一致
---
<div class="skyline" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .skyline {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image: url(/skyline.svg);
    background-repeat: repeat-x;
  }
</style>
